OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FUnsettled at times, with rain
OL,7,Faffecting mostly northern areas as
OL,8,Fwell as England and Wales. Brighter
OL,9,Fspells develop elsewhere. Generally
OL,10,Fwarmer in the south, with temperatures
OL,11,Fnearer average further north.
